            "review_title": "Review at Com Nieu Thien Ly",
            "review_text": "Daydream19574088276\n1 contribution\n0\nNot hygiene in Nguyen Duy Trinh Q2\nJan 2026 • Family\nThe food here has a very nice taste—fresh and well-prepared, with a skilled chef on Nguyen Duy Trinh Street. 👍 \nHowever, I do have concerns about the service and hygiene. One evening, we arrived about an hour before closing and one overheard staff swearing in the back 🫣. We understand that and only ordered “easy” food hope to help them take it easy 😅\nOn another visit, we unfortunately found a piece of stainless steel sponge in our food - so disgusting and dangerous- but didnt want to make a big deal so didnt show it to them. \nWrite here to hope the owner make it better . Very good taste food and convenience so dont want it turn badly like “Com Tam Cali, Kieu Giang” \nPlease keep it hygiene- very important key \nThanks\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nNeed more hygiene\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 19, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
